<div class="admin-card" id="setup-help"><h2>Installation checks</h2><p>These are local configuration checks; they do not prove public reachability or email delivery.</p><dl class="readiness"><dt>Detected app path</dt><dd><code><?=e(appBasePath() ?: '/')?></code></dd><dt>Private storage</dt><dd><?=is_writable(ROOT.'/storage')?'Writable':'Not writable — ask your host to grant PHP access'?></dd><dt>Gallery / SEO schema</dt><dd><?=tableExists('project_photos') && tableExists('seo_settings')?'Present':'Update required: php bin/upgrade.php'?></dd><dt>Social publishing schema</dt><dd><?=tableExists('social_jobs') && tableExists('social_accounts') && tableExists('social_profiles')?'Present':'Update required: php bin/upgrade.php'?></dd><dt>PHP image support</dt><dd><?=extension_loaded('gd')?'Available':'GD extension missing'?></dd><dt>PHP HTTP client</dt><dd><?=extension_loaded('curl')?'Available':'cURL extension missing'?></dd><dt>Per-file PHP limit</dt><dd><?=e(ini_get('upload_max_filesize'))?></dd><dt>Total request PHP limit</dt><dd><?=e(ini_get('post_max_size'))?> (use at least 64M for large multi-photo batches)</dd><dt>Email notification switch</dt><dd><?=$config['notify_email']?'Enabled; actual inbox delivery still needs verification':'Disabled; enquiries still save in the admin inbox'?></dd><dt>Production HTTPS enforcement</dt><dd><?=$config['production']?'Enabled':'Disabled for local development'?></dd></dl></div>
